{"resourceIdentifier":"4057","resourceName":"Guangzhou Xingfeng landfill gas to LNG Project","description":"Guangzhou Xingfeng landfill gas to LNG Project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Xingfengemergency landfill site in Baiyun district, Guangzhou City, Guangdong Province, P.R.China. The project is implemented by Guangzhou Huantou Environment Service Co.,Ltd (hereafter referred to as the project owner).\r\nThe purpose of the project is to utilize landfill gas (LFG), which consists mainly of methane, for LNG production for sale and electricity generation for self use. It includes LFG collection system, LFG pre-treatment system, and, liquefaction, by-product recovery, storing, loading, electricity generation, flare system, etc. LFG collected will be used for LNG production for sale and electricity generation with internal combustion generators for self use. The project started to construct on21/Feb/2020 and operated on 04/Aug/2021.The landfill gas treatment capacity of the project is 300,000 m3 per day(200,000 m3for LNG production and 100,000 m3for electricity generation). Greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions will be reduced by avoiding GHG emissions from releasing LFG into atmosphere at the landfill site. Meanwhile supplying liquefied LFG to consumers using trucks reduce GHG emissions from the use of natural gas. The expected average annual emission reductions are 392,583 tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.","location":{"latitude":23.268055,"longitude":113.494444},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-02-23","endExclusive":"2023-03-26","endInclusive":"2023-03-25"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4057"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","v